+# T9 SSG Toolkit — Contract
+
+All 8 plugins implement `Plugin` from `src/core/types.ts`, exporting a `createXxxPlugin()` factory.
+Verification: `npm test` (15 core + 60 plugin), `npm run build`, `npm run lint`.
+
+## Wave 1
+
+### markdown-ext (deps: [])
+- [ ] transformContent: basic md → HTML (`<h1>`, `Hello`, `<strong>bold</strong>`)
+- [ ] footnote ref `[^1]` → `<sup><a href="#fn-1">1</a></sup>`
+- [ ] footnote defs `[^1]: text` → `<section class="footnotes">` with `<li id="fn-1">First note.</li>`
+- [ ] `:::note`/`:::warning`/`:::tip` → `<div class="admonition admonition-X">...text...</div>`
+- [ ] preserve existing HTML; empty content → defined
+
+### asset-pipeline (deps: [])
+- [ ] rewrite `src="./x.png"`/`href="./x.pdf"` → `/assets/x.png`
+- [ ] absolute URLs unchanged
+- [ ] manifest `ctx.data['asset-manifest'] = { assets: string[] }` (filenames), accumulates across files
+- [ ] no refs → content unchanged; already `/assets/` not double-processed (manifest empty/undefined)
+
+### syntax-highlight (deps: [])
+- [ ] `<pre><code class="language-X">` → add ` highlighted` to code class + `data-language="X"` on pre
+- [ ] multiple blocks; no-language pre unchanged; empty code w/ lang processed; inline `<code>` untouched
+
+### taxonomy (deps: [])
+- [ ] beforeBuild: build `ctx.data['taxonomy-tags']: Map<string, ContentFile[]>`, tags lowercased
+- [ ] afterBuild: `tags/<tag>.html` listing file titles
+- [ ] no/empty tags → map size 0
+
+## Wave 2
+
+### rss-feed (deps: markdown-ext, taxonomy)
+- [ ] afterBuild: `feed.xml` valid RSS 2.0 (`<?xml`, `<rss version="2.0">`, channel/item/`</rss>`)
+- [ ] item description CDATA HTML; categories from tags `<category>javascript</category>`
+- [ ] channel `<title>Test Site</title>`; sorted newest-first; no `<pubDate>undefined</pubDate>`
+- [ ] channel `<link>baseUrl</link>`, item `<link>baseUrl/slug.html</link>`
+
+### search-index (deps: markdown-ext, syntax-highlight)
+- [ ] afterBuild: `search-index.json` array of `{title, slug, content(plain text), tags?}`
+- [ ] HTML stripped, code text kept; empty list → `[]`
+
+## Wave 3
+
+### sitemap (deps: taxonomy, rss-feed)
+- [ ] afterBuild: `sitemap.xml` valid (`<?xml`, `<urlset`, `<url>`, `<loc>`, `</urlset>`)
+- [ ] include all output page URLs (content, tag pages, feed.xml) using baseUrl; no tag pages → no `/tags/`
+
+### dev-server (deps: asset-pipeline, search-index)
+- [ ] afterBuild: `ctx.data['dev-server-config']` `{port:3000, routes:[{path,handler}], assetPaths, searchIndexPath}`
+- [ ] asset routes (handler 'asset') from manifest; content routes (handler 'static') from .html output
+- [ ] searchIndexPath `/search-index.json` when present; missing asset data → assetPaths `[]`
